      "itemId": "996ca80f-b09a-43e4-908e-fc8c381b252e",
      "text": "Starting with 43 books: (43 − 8) × 2 = 70; after discarding 2, 68 split among 4 gives 17 kept. Then 17 − 3 + (8 × 11) = 102.\n\n102",
