      "itemId": "4ba4f4d3-e401-4f65-a7ae-f3d7d634999b",
      "text": "The warehouse starts with 20 parcels. Adding 4 crates of 11 gives 64 parcels. Each of the three rounds keeps one-fourth:\n64 ÷ 4 = 16\n16 ÷ 4 = 4\n4 ÷ 4 = 1\n\nFinal number: 1",
